title: Neorevisionist leaders resign
new-page: true 
subtitle: Reformist disagreements with our policies have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: not neorev_split and ((spd_centrist and neorevisionist_dissent >= 70) or (not spd_centrist and neorevisionist_dissent >= 60))
on-arrival: neorevisionist_strength *= 0.3; workers_spd -= 10; workers_others += 5; neorev_split = 1
go-to: srpd_formed

= Neorevisionist leaders resign

Our policy choices have greatly offended the Neorevisionist faction. Many of our most fierce leaders have resigned. Most of them went to form **Social Republican Party of Germany**, our republican counterpart.
